Save safety hooks for the port (DuskOnVita, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md). Two weak extern "C"
hooks; without a definition (any other build) the card behaves exactly as before.

aurora_card_gci_before_change(folder, file, reason): CardGciFolder calls it before it
overwrites (CARDWrite, status commit), deletes (move to _deleted) or renames a .gci, while
the previous version is still on disk. Once per open...close cycle for an open file (one game
save = one CARDOpen, several CARDWrites and a status commit), every time for a change to a
closed file. The hook only reads the file; it cannot fail or delay the change past its own
return, and the change runs unmodified after it.

aurora_card_gci_before_mount(folder, game, maker, slot): CARDInit calls it for each
GCI-folder card before it checks and opens the folder, so the port can report or repair a
broken save and copy in a save from another build when the card has none.

